  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of <math><mi>n</mi></math> items is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math> If the first item is increased by <math><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo></math> second by <math><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and so on and last by <math><mn>1,</mn></math> then the new mean is"
